(1, 'Kentron Central Apartment', 'Yerevan – Kentron', 285000, 'Apartment', 3, 2, 110, 'For Sale', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A bright apartment just steps from Republic Square and the Cascade, in the lively heart of Yerevan. Tall windows, a renovated kitchen, and a balcony overlooking the tree-lined avenue make city living feel calm.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Renovated kitchen","City-center location","Balcony over the avenue","Central heating","Walk to the Cascade","Secure entrance"]'::jsonb, 2018, 1, 'sale', null, 40.1792, 44.5152, true),
(2, 'Arabkir Hillside Home', 'Yerevan – Arabkir', 340000, 'House', 4, 2, 180, 'For Sale', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A family house on the quiet uphill streets of Arabkir, with a private garden and clear views toward Mount Ararat. Spacious rooms, warm finishes, and a calm setting just minutes from the city center.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605276374104-dee2a0ed3cd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Mount Ararat views","Private garden","Two-car garage","Quiet district","Underfloor heating","Storage cellar"]'::jsonb, 2016, 2, 'sale', null, 40.207, 44.49, true),
(3, 'Dilijan Forest Villa', 'Dilijan', 410000, 'Villa', 4, 3, 260, 'New', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A serene villa tucked into the forests of Dilijan — Armenia''s "Little Switzerland." Vaulted ceilings, a stone fireplace, and a wraparound terrace bring the green hills right to your door.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605276374104-dee2a0ed3cd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Forest setting","Stone fireplace","Wraparound terrace","Mountain spring water","Two-car garage","Floor heating"]'::jsonb, 2021, 2, 'sale', null, 40.74, 44.862, true),
(4, 'Tsaghkadzor Slope Chalet', 'Tsaghkadzor', 365000, 'House', 4, 2, 210, 'For Sale', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A mountain chalet moments from the Tsaghkadzor ropeway and ski slopes. A double-height living room, a crackling fireplace, and balconies built for fresh alpine mornings year-round.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Near the ski ropeway","Mountain views","Fireplace","Ski storage","Sunny balconies","Central heating"]'::jsonb, 2019, 1, 'sale', null, 40.53, 44.719, true),
(5, 'Lake Sevan View Estate', 'Sevan', 520000, 'Estate', 5, 3, 380, 'Available', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'An elegant estate set above the blue expanse of Lake Sevan, with landscaped grounds and wide terraces for long summer evenings. Generous living spaces and a guest suite make it ideal for gatherings.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576941089067-2de3c901e126?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1439066615861-d1af74d74000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Lake Sevan views","Landscaped grounds","Three-car garage","Large terrace","Guest suite","Underfloor heating"]'::jsonb, 2020, 3, 'sale', null, 40.556, 44.951, true),
(6, 'Gyumri Heritage House', 'Gyumri', 145000, 'House', 4, 2, 200, 'For Sale', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605276374104-dee2a0ed3cd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A characterful house in Gyumri''s historic Kumayri district, built from the city''s signature black-and-red tuff stone. Carefully restored interiors keep the craftsmanship while adding modern comfort.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605276374104-dee2a0ed3cd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576941089067-2de3c901e126?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Historic tuff stone","Kumayri old district","Restored interiors","Inner courtyard","Carved wood details","Central location"]'::jsonb, 2002, 1, 'sale', null, 40.7894, 43.8475, true),
(7, 'Jermuk Spa Villa', 'Jermuk', 295000, 'Villa', 4, 3, 240, 'New', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A restful villa in the spa town of Jermuk, famous for its mineral springs and mountain air. Light-filled rooms, a private sauna, and a balcony facing the surrounding forested gorge.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Near mineral springs","Clean mountain air","Private sauna","Two-car garage","Large balcony","Gorge views"]'::jsonb, 2022, 2, 'sale', null, 39.841, 45.673, true),
(8, 'Goris Stone Cottage', 'Goris', 98000, 'House', 3, 1, 140, 'Available', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A traditional stone cottage in Goris, framed by dramatic mountain valleys near the cave village of Old Khndzoresk. A fruit garden, a wood stove, and a quiet pace make it a true escape.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Traditional stone build","Mountain valley views","Fruit garden","Wood stove","Quiet setting","Near Old Khndzoresk"]'::jsonb, 2005, 0, 'sale', null, 39.511, 46.338, true),
(9, 'Ijevan Valley Retreat', 'Ijevan', 260000, 'Estate', 4, 3, 300, 'For Sale', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576941089067-2de3c901e126?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A green retreat in the forested Tavush region, overlooking the Aghstev river valley near Ijevan. Wide terraces, an orchard, and birdsong make it a peaceful base in Armenia''s north-east.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576941089067-2de3c901e126?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Tavush forest views","River valley setting","Two-car garage","Fruit orchard","Sun terrace","Floor heating"]'::jsonb, 2017, 2, 'sale', null, 40.879, 45.147, true),
(10, 'Cascade District Apartment', 'Yerevan – Kentron', 1400, 'Apartment', 2, 1, 85, 'For Rent', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A fully furnished apartment beside the Cascade Complex, in the most walkable part of Yerevan. Bright, modern, and ready to move into, with cafés and galleries right outside the door.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Furnished","Beside the Cascade","Air conditioning","Balcony","Elevator building","Central heating"]'::jsonb, 2019, 0, 'rent', 'month', 40.188, 44.515, true),
(11, 'Arabkir Modern Flat', 'Yerevan – Arabkir', 900, 'Apartment', 2, 1, 70, 'For Rent', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580587771525-78b9dba3b914?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A newly renovated flat on a calm Arabkir street, fully furnished and ready for comfortable everyday living. Close to shops, schools, and quick transport into the city center.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580587771525-78b9dba3b914?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605276374104-dee2a0ed3cd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Furnished","Newly renovated","Quiet street","Balcony","Parking nearby","Internet ready"]'::jsonb, 2020, 0, 'rent', 'month', 40.209, 44.488, true),
(12, 'Dilijan Garden House', 'Dilijan', 1100, 'House', 3, 2, 150, 'For Rent', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A cozy house with a private garden on the forested edge of Dilijan, perfect for a longer stay in nature. A fireplace, a covered porch, and spring-fresh air just outside town.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605276374104-dee2a0ed3cd6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Private garden","Forest setting","Fireplace","Off-street parking","Furnished","Mountain spring water"]'::jsonb, 2018, 1, 'rent', 'month', 40.742, 44.86, true),
(13, 'Sevan Lakeside Cabin', 'Sevan', 750, 'House', 2, 1, 95, 'For Rent', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A simple, charming cabin a short walk from the shores of Lake Sevan. A wood stove, a sunny terrace, and wide water views make it a favourite for seasonal getaways.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1439066615861-d1af74d74000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Walk to Lake Sevan","Wood stove","Sun terrace","Furnished","Off-street parking","Great for summers"]'::jsonb, 2017, 1, 'rent', 'month', 40.553, 44.954, true),
(14, 'Nork Panorama Apartment', 'Yerevan – Nork', 2200, 'Apartment', 3, 2, 130, 'For Rent', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A premium apartment on the Nork heights with panoramic views across Yerevan to Mount Ararat. Fully furnished, with two balconies, underground parking, and a building concierge.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576941089067-2de3c901e126?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Panoramic city views","Furnished","Underground parking","Two balconies","Air conditioning","Concierge"]'::jsonb, 2021, 1, 'rent', 'month', 40.185, 44.54, true),
(15, 'Nork Garden Apartment', 'Yerevan – Nork', 310000, 'Apartment', 3, 2, 125, 'New', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A bright, contemporary apartment on the green Nork heights, with a generous balcony framing the Yerevan skyline and Mount Ararat beyond. Move-in ready, with quality finishes throughout.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576941089067-2de3c901e126?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Ararat views","Large balcony","Modern finishes","Underground parking","Air conditioning","Quiet street"]'::jsonb, 2022, 1, 'sale', null, 40.187, 44.545, true),
(16, 'Opera District Flat', 'Yerevan – Kentron', 1600, 'Apartment', 2, 1, 92, 'For Rent', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80', 'A stylish furnished flat steps from the Opera House and Northern Avenue, in the most walkable part of Yerevan. Cafés, parks, and galleries are all at your doorstep.', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492493-0946911123ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565008576549-57569a49371d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]'::jsonb, '["Furnished","By the Opera House","Walk to Northern Avenue","Air conditioning","Elevator building","Central heating"]'::jsonb, 2020, 0, 'rent', 'month', 40.183, 44.513, true),
